stringTools
===========

Low-level string handling, used by every other part of Pyxplot, including the
helper programs. This code depends on nothing else in Pyxplot.

asciidouble.c, asciidouble.h
    Functions for parsing numbers from strings and rendering numbers as text,
    reading lines from files, splitting, stripping and comparing strings,
    matching abbreviations and wildcards, and measuring and indexing UTF-8
    strings by character. Also provides ppl_snprintfTrunc() and
    ppl_strAppendf(), which write into fixed-size buffers safely.

strConstants.h
    The standard sizes of Pyxplot's character buffers: LSTR_LENGTH for long
    strings such as command lines, FNAME_LENGTH for filenames, and SSTR_LENGTH
    for short strings.
